You MAY NOT:
  * Sell, sublicense, rent, lease, or otherwise distribute Maestro or
    any derivative of it for a fee or other consideration.
  * Offer Maestro, or any derivative of it, as part of a paid product,
    hosted service, API, headless deployment, or integration.
  * Use Maestro to provide cloud-based, backend, embedded, automated,
    or other end-user-accessible services where users access, invoke,
    or pay for those services.

